{"id":"b28efaa3c7df6cd2","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-delta2.md","title":"Every Interpretability Degree Has a Delta-2 Representative","display":"thm-degree-delta2 — Every Interpretability Degree Has a Delta-2 Representative","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-delta2","aliases":["67-thm-degree-delta2"],"display":"thm-degree-delta2 — Every Interpretability Degree Has a Delta-2 Representative","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§2","source_label":"Theorem 7.8","source_printed_pages":[102],"source_pdf_pages":[113],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"book-proof-read; coding and conservativity dependencies not independently audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-delta2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-delta2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-delta2 — Every Interpretability Degree Has a Delta-2 Representative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>113</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"book-proof-read; coding and conservativity dependencies not independently audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathsf D_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathsf D_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a> 及其固定一致 r.e. 基础理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的定义：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 上与对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2/\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2/\\Pi_2\\)</span> 句可证明等价；与源书无上标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 对应。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_T=\\mathsf D_T(\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_T=\\mathsf D_T(\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章定理8（印刷102页，PDF113页）。结论是每个度都存在一个单句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 代表，不是所有 r.e. 理论的公理集均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span>，也不是每个理论都只有该复杂度的定理。</p>\n<p>已阅读书面证明：先以原始递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句集表示度，再用自指句构造出与该句集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 保守等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span> 句，并展示其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span> 等价形式。第5–6章的保守扩张、表达式编码及辅助引理本次未全部独立重证；状态仅表示陈述对照和书面证明阅读。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf D_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 及其固定一致 r.e. 基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-a